      "text": {
        "jp": "そこには絶世の美女が住んでいるのだよ。\r\n君もぜひ会ってきてはいかがかな？",
        "official_en": "There lives a woman of otherworldly beauty. If that doesn’t pique your interest, I’m not sure what will.",
        "real_en": "An incredibly beautiful woman lives there. Why don't you go meet her?"
