      "text": {
        "jp": "ただ、ちょっとばかし気性が荒くてね。\r\n怒ると相手を氷漬けにしてしまうんだ。\r\n幻獣？　さぁて、なんのことかね。",
        "official_en": "Be warned though, she has quite the temper—she’ll freeze you solid if you so much as look at her the wrong way... An esper, you say? I’m not quite sure what you’re talking about.",
        "real_en": "She's a little quick-tempered, though. If she gets angry, she'll freeze whoever upset her solid. An Eidolon? Whatever do you mean?"
